{"id":"b475d7d49a565a3e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3Atoms.md","title":"L3Atoms","display":"L3Atoms","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3Atoms","parameters":["g","a","P"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3Atoms"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>a</span><span>P</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：三值语义与有限表证书。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>P</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3Atoms g a P)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(forall n (iff (in n P) (exists b (and (or (in b g) (= b a)) (@ L3Atom n b)))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a72a7415899dbdf4\" href=\"?note=a72a7415899dbdf4\" title=\"ZFC_L3Atom\">L3Atom</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ L3Atoms g a P)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_L3Atom","status":"resolved","id":"a72a7415899dbdf4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_L3Atom|L3Atom]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":795,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd45a4b3eda7a6d6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3Atoms|L3Atoms]]"},{"id":"8dfa83196961379b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_L3Atoms|L3Atoms]]；[[ZFC_L3FiniteInput|L3FiniteInput]]；[[ZFC_Num3|Num3]]；[[ZFC_Space|Space]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-731","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_L3Atoms|L3Atoms]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","a72a7415899dbdf4","593f9bdab4d60707"]}